1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,968
Ava: A Helion kernel can lower into thousands of Triton kernels, and choosing among them can dominate the wait.
Ava：一个 Helion 内核可 lower 成数千个 Triton 内核，而在这些候选中做选择可能占据大部分等待时间。

2
00:00:07,968 --> 00:00:16,286
One earlier paged-attention effort tuned 72 shapes for 10 hours in quick mode and 25 hours at full effort.
此前一项 paged-attention 工作在 quick 模式下为 72 种形状调优 10 小时，在 full effort 下调优 25 小时。

3
00:00:16,286 --> 00:00:18,429
Brian: That's why this work matters.
Brian：这正是这项工作重要的原因。

4
00:00:18,429 --> 00:00:28,756
Helion now reads a kernel's IR and dataflow at compile time, emits a config directly, and gets near-autotuned speed without autotuning.
Helion 现在在编译时读取内核的 IR 和数据流，直接生成配置，无需 autotuning 也能达到接近自动调优的速度。

5
00:00:28,756 --> 00:00:31,990
Ava: So the compiler isn't searching every candidate.
Ava：所以编译器不会搜索每个候选项。

6
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:36,114
How does it decide which kind of kernel it's looking at?
它如何判断正在处理哪一类内核？

7
00:00:36,114 --> 00:00:41,842
Brian: The first pass classifies kernels into matmul, reduction, or pointwise families.
Brian：第一遍会把内核归入 matmul、reduction 或 pointwise 类别。

8
00:00:41,842 --> 00:00:53,656
Any matmul, including hl.dot or torch.baddbmm, takes the matmul heuristic; a reduction with no matmul takes the reduction heuristic; everything else takes pointwise.
任何 matmul（包括 hl.dot 或 torch.baddbmm）都采用 matmul 启发式；不含 matmul 的 reduction 采用 reduction 启发式；其余采用 pointwise。

9
00:00:53,656 --> 00:00:58,739
The families are broad on purpose, so they apply to custom kernels too.
这些类别特意设得很宽，因此也适用于自定义内核。

10
00:00:58,739 --> 00:01:06,392
If all extents aren't known at compile time, no heuristic fires and Helion keeps its original default.
如果编译时无法得知所有 extent，任何启发式都不会触发，Helion 会保留原有默认值。

11
00:01:06,392 --> 00:01:08,950
Ava: What exactly is emitted?
Ava：具体会生成什么？

12
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:13,724
Brian: A primary heuristic emits the default config when autotuning is off.
Brian：关闭 autotuning 时，主启发式会生成默认配置。

13
00:01:13,724 --> 00:01:20,463
With autotuning on, helper heuristics add roughly 5 to 20 related configs to seed the autotuner.
开启 autotuning 后，辅助启发式会增加大约 5 到 20 个相关配置，为 autotuner 提供种子。

14
00:01:20,463 --> 00:01:28,956
The primary config should be strong by itself; the seeds are meant to make the later search start in a better place.
主配置本身应当足够强；这些种子旨在让后续搜索从更好的起点开始。

15
00:01:28,956 --> 00:01:34,226
Ava: That sounds like a deliberate tradeoff between performance and wait time.
Ava：听起来这是在性能和等待时间之间有意做出的权衡。

16
00:01:34,226 --> 00:01:34,818
Brian: Exactly.
Brian：正是。

17
00:01:34,818 --> 00:01:41,258
Autotuning can benchmark thousands of configs, so the goal isn't to beat a full search.
autotuning 可能要测试数千个配置，因此目标不是胜过完整搜索。

18
00:01:41,258 --> 00:01:45,773
It's to add a useful point between performance and wait time.
而是在性能与等待时间之间提供一个实用折中。

19
00:01:45,773 --> 00:01:54,784
The analysis itself changes compile time by only tens of milliseconds, which is negligible beside Triton compilation.
分析本身只会让编译时间增加几十毫秒，相比 Triton 编译几乎可以忽略。

20
00:01:54,784 --> 00:01:57,630
Ava: What does the common analysis measure?
Ava：通用分析会测量什么？

21
00:01:57,630 --> 00:02:07,468
Brian: For candidate block sizes, it estimates, at each kernel step, how many registers, shared memory, and, on Blackwell, tensor memory one CTA needs.
Brian：对于候选 block size，它会估算每个内核步骤中一个 CTA 需要多少寄存器、共享内存，以及在 Blackwell 上需要多少 tensor memory。

22
00:02:07,468 --> 00:02:13,958
It uses liveness analysis to find each value's last use and guesses where Triton will place it.
它利用 liveness analysis 找出每个值的最后一次使用，并猜测 Triton 会把它放在哪里。

23
00:02:13,958 --> 00:02:22,916
That estimate is approximate because Triton may keep values in registers, stage them through shared memory, or fuse them away.
这个估算只是近似值，因为 Triton 可能把值保存在寄存器中、通过共享内存分阶段暂存，或将其融合掉。

24
00:02:22,916 --> 00:02:25,935
Ava: That estimate feeds occupancy.
Ava：这个估算会用于计算 occupancy。

25
00:02:25,935 --> 00:02:44,698
If a CTA uses 0.1 of an SM's registers, 0.1 of its shared memory, and 0.6 of its tensor memory, two CTAs would need 1.2 times the tensor-memory budget, so only one CTA fits on the SM.
如果一个 CTA 使用某个 SM 寄存器容量的 0.1、共享内存容量的 0.1 和 tensor memory 容量的 0.6，那么两个 CTA 就需要 1.2 倍的 tensor-memory 预算，因此该 SM 只能容纳一个 CTA。

26
00:02:44,698 --> 00:02:51,421
Brian: Peak live registers spread over the threads tell the heuristic whether the assembler may spill.
Brian：线程间分摊的峰值 live registers 能让启发式判断 assembler 是否可能 spill。

27
00:02:51,421 --> 00:03:01,536
After choosing settings, a pessimistic feasibility pass adds tensor memory, shared memory, and registers to confirm the config can launch.
选定设置后，悲观可行性检查会把 tensor memory、共享内存和寄存器纳入计算，确认该配置可以启动。

28
00:03:01,536 --> 00:03:04,502
Ava: How does that become a matmul config?
Ava：这些结果如何转成 matmul 配置？

29
00:03:04,502 --> 00:03:16,669
Brian: For block_size, if the launch would create fewer CTAs than the GPU has SMs, the heuristic shrinks a grid-axis block so it creates more CTAs.
Brian：对于 block_size，如果启动会产生少于 GPU SM 数量的 CTA，启发式就缩小某个网格轴上的 block，以生成更多 CTA。

30
00:03:16,669 --> 00:03:32,140
For num_stages, more stages hide load latency, but six stages could consume the shared-memory budget and leave one CTA per SM, while three stages might allow two CTAs per SM.
对于 num_stages，更多 stage 可以隐藏加载延迟，但 6 个 stage 可能耗尽共享内存预算，使每个 SM 只剩 1 个 CTA；而 3 个 stage 可能让每个 SM 容纳 2 个 CTA。

31
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:36,090
Ava: And num_warps has two competing effects.
Ava：而 num_warps 有两种相互竞争的影响。

32
00:03:36,090 --> 00:03:42,945
Brian: Below four warps, or with an M block under 64, Triton emits the smaller synchronous MMA.
Brian：当 warp 数少于 4，或 M block 小于 64 时，Triton 会生成较小的同步 MMA。

33
00:03:42,945 --> 00:03:50,812
Otherwise it can use the larger high-throughput instruction, wgmma on Hopper or tcgen05 on Blackwell.
否则它可以使用更大的高吞吐指令：Hopper 上是 wgmma，Blackwell 上是 tcgen05。

34
00:03:50,812 --> 00:03:59,459
Usually the larger instruction wins, but with little matmul work, more CTAs using small MMAs can overlap loads.
通常较大的指令更胜一筹，但 matmul 工作量较少时，更多采用小 MMA 的 CTA 可以与加载重叠。

35
00:03:59,459 --> 00:04:08,144
The heuristic counts dynamic matmul work and also raises warps when register pressure would cause spilling.
启发式会统计动态 matmul 工作量，并在寄存器压力可能导致 spill 时增加 warp 数。

36
00:04:08,144 --> 00:04:19,246
Ava: When a kernel has multiple matmuls, such as attention or linear attention, each hl.dot gets a starting answer, but shared knobs can conflict.
Ava：当内核包含多个 matmul（例如 attention 或 linear attention）时，每个 hl.dot 都会得到一个初始答案，但共享参数可能冲突。

37
00:04:19,246 --> 00:04:22,125
Brian: The heuristic ranks dots by importance.
Brian：启发式会按重要性给各个 dot 排名。

38
00:04:22,125 --> 00:04:28,252
A loop-carried accumulator comes first, then dynamic matmul work, then output area.
循环携带的累加器优先，其次是动态 matmul 工作量，最后是输出区域。

39
00:04:28,252 --> 00:04:35,172
The higher-ranked dot wins whenever they disagree about a shared block size or num_warps.
当它们对共享 block size 或 num_warps 有分歧时，排名更高的 dot 优先。

40
00:04:35,172 --> 00:04:41,324
Ava: Reduction kernels use the same resource picture, but their choices differ.
Ava：reduction 内核使用相同的资源模型，但选择不同。

41
00:04:41,324 --> 00:04:50,386
The warp count starts from the largest reduction, then tests fewer warps for residency and register pressure.
warp 数先从最大的 reduction 开始，再测试更少的 warp，以评估驻留和寄存器压力。

42
00:04:50,386 --> 00:04:58,634
A reduction over 128 elements may need one or two warps, while 16,384 elements needs many more.
对 128 个元素做 reduction 可能只需 1 或 2 个 warp，而 16,384 个元素则需要多得多。

43
00:04:58,634 --> 00:05:06,528
Brian: Block sizes can shrink to fit more CTAs per SM, but the stride-one axis must stay wide enough for coalesced loads.
Brian：block size 可以缩小，以便每个 SM 容纳更多 CTA，但 stride-one 轴必须保持足够宽，才能进行合并加载。

44
00:05:06,528 --> 00:05:15,738
Persistence is allowed to trade some spilling or residency for avoiding a second memory read when a row is read twice, as in RMSNorm.
在 RMSNorm 这类一行读取两次的场景中，Persistence 可以牺牲少量 spill 或 residency，避免第二次内存读取。

45
00:05:15,738 --> 00:05:24,328
Because block size and warp count affect each other, the heuristic iterates until both stay unchanged for a full round.
由于 block size 和 warp 数会相互影响，启发式会迭代，直到两者在完整一轮中都保持不变。

46
00:05:24,328 --> 00:05:26,189
Ava: Let's talk results.
Ava：来谈谈结果。

47
00:05:26,189 --> 00:05:38,436
The linear-attention test covered nine variants, six production shapes, and H100, in forward and forward-plus-backward modes.
线性注意力测试覆盖 9 个变体、6 种生产形状，并在 H100 上测试了 forward 和 forward-plus-backward 模式。

48
00:05:38,436 --> 00:05:49,758
The shapes ranged from batch 1 to 8, heads 8 to 96, sequence length 1024 to 16384, and head dimension 64 to 256.
这些形状的 batch 为 1 到 8、heads 为 8 到 96、sequence length 为 1024 到 16384，head dimension 为 64 到 256。

49
00:05:49,758 --> 00:05:59,474
Brian: Against handwritten Triton in FLA, the computed config reached 1.18x in forward and 1.12x with backward included.
Brian：与 FLA 中手写的 Triton 实现相比，计算得到的配置在 forward 中达到 1.18x，包含 backward 时达到 1.12x。

50
00:05:59,474 --> 00:06:08,852
Across 96 kernel-and-shape cells, it was 2.13x faster than Helion's previous no-autotune default on H100.
在 96 个内核与形状组合中，它在 H100 上比 Helion 之前的 no-autotune 默认配置快 2.13 倍。

51
00:06:08,852 --> 00:06:18,982
Ava: Before the heuristics, the choice was 0.52x of FLA with no autotuning or 1.26x after full autotuning.
Ava：在采用启发式规则之前，选择是：不进行自动调优时达到 FLA 的 0.52x，完全自动调优后达到 1.26x。

52
00:06:18,982 --> 00:06:25,450
The heuristic gives 1.18x without paying the autotuning cost.
启发式方法可在无需承担自动调优开销的情况下达到 1.18x。

53
00:06:25,450 --> 00:06:34,313
Ava: vLLM's test covered six production reduction kernels and 153 kernel-and-shape cells on H100.
Ava：vLLM 的测试涵盖 H100 上 6 个生产级归约内核，以及 153 个内核与形状组合单元。

54
00:06:34,313 --> 00:06:46,704
They include two FP8 quantizers, RMSNorm and SiLU-and-multiply fused with quantization, and fused QK-normalization plus RoPE.
其中包括两个 FP8 量化器、RMSNorm、与量化融合的 SiLU-and-multiply，以及融合的 QK-normalization 与 RoPE。

55
00:06:46,704 --> 00:06:58,775
Brian: The computed config reached 1.27x vLLM's handwritten CUDA/C++ operators, versus 0.58x for Helion's previous default and 1.31x with full autotuning.
Brian：计算得到的配置达到 vLLM 手写 CUDA/C++ 算子的 1.27x；Helion 之前的默认配置为 0.58x，完全自动调优为 1.31x。

56
00:06:58,775 --> 00:07:11,606
So full autotuning bought only about 3 percent over the free config on these kernels, and the computed config was 2.2x faster than the previous default.
因此，在这些内核上，完全自动调优相较于免调优配置只带来约 3% 的提升，而计算得到的配置比之前的默认配置快 2.2x。

57
00:07:11,606 --> 00:07:19,917
Ava: For everyday kernels, they forced torch.compile(mode="max-autotune-no-cudagraphs") onto Triton.
Ava：对于日常内核，他们让 Triton 强制使用 torch.compile(mode="max-autotune-no-cudagraphs")。

58
00:07:19,917 --> 00:07:33,652
On ten reduction kernels and 80 kernel-shape combinations, the computed config reached 1.09x of that baseline, while Helion's unseeded default was 0.27x.
在 10 个归约内核和 80 个内核-形状组合上，计算得到的配置达到该基线的 1.09x，而 Helion 未设种子的默认配置为 0.27x。

59
00:07:33,652 --> 00:07:45,766
Brian: Across 13 matmul families and 70 shapes, the computed config reached 1.88x of max-autotune torch.compile, versus 0.51x for Helion's default.
Brian：在 13 个矩阵乘系列和 70 种形状中，计算得到的配置达到 max-autotune torch.compile 的 1.88x，而 Helion 默认配置为 0.51x。

60
00:07:45,766 --> 00:07:56,668
The comparison isn't always apples-to-apples because some PyTorch implementations materialize intermediates that Helion fuses.
这个比较并非总是完全可比，因为一些 PyTorch 实现会显式生成 Helion 会融合的中间结果。

61
00:07:56,668 --> 00:08:06,450
Jagged HSTU attention is a real regression: the old default reached 3.72x, while the heuristic reached 3.27x.
Jagged HSTU 注意力确实出现性能回退：旧默认配置达到 3.72x，而启发式方法达到 3.27x。

62
00:08:06,450 --> 00:08:09,531
Ava: The helper configs also seed the autotuner.
Ava：辅助配置还会为自动调优器提供种子。

63
00:08:09,531 --> 00:08:21,272
The test used 38 matmul and multi-matmul kernels, one shape per kernel, and compared random starting populations with seeded populations under full autotuning.
测试使用了 38 个 matmul 和 multi-matmul 内核，每个内核一个形状，并在完全自动调优下比较随机初始种群与带种子种群。

64
00:08:21,272 --> 00:08:24,245
Brian: Seeding helps early, not late.
Brian：种子在早期有帮助，后期没有。

65
00:08:24,245 --> 00:08:48,230
Across the 38 cells, median counts to get within 50% of the best found were 35.5 configs without seeds and 1.0 with seeds; within 25% took 103.5 versus 2.5; within 5% took 255.5 versus 175.0; and completing the search took 521.5 versus 420.5.
在 38 个单元中，与已找到的最佳结果相差不超过 50% 时，配置数中位数为无种子 35.5、带种子 1.0；不超过 25% 时为 103.5 对 2.5；不超过 5% 时为 255.5 对 175.0；完成搜索则为 521.5 对 420.5。

66
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:59,086
Those counts include configs that failed to compile or produce a timing because they still consume budget.
这些计数包括编译失败或无法生成计时结果的配置，因为它们仍会消耗预算。

67
00:08:59,086 --> 00:09:13,524
Ava: So seeds cut the early budget by 35x to get something decent and 41x to get within 25%, but only 1.5x to get within 5% and 1.2x to finish.
Ava：因此，种子使达到尚可结果所需的早期预算减少 35x，使结果进入 25% 范围内所需预算减少 41x；但进入 5% 范围内只减少 1.5x，完成搜索只减少 1.2x。

68
00:09:13,524 --> 00:09:16,134
Brian: They don't improve the final answer.
Brian：它们不会改善最终结果。

69
00:09:16,134 --> 00:09:21,499
Replaying both winners on one GPU put them within a fraction of a percent.
在同一块 GPU 上重放两个最佳配置后，二者差距不到一个百分点的一小部分。

70
00:09:21,499 --> 00:09:27,866
Seeding changes how fast the search finds a good config, not where the search ends.
种子改变的是搜索找到优良配置的速度，而不是搜索最终停留的位置。

71
00:09:27,866 --> 00:09:30,640
Ava: What should engineers keep in mind?
Ava：工程师应牢记什么？

72
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:35,729
Brian: The central limitation is that the heuristics predict Triton's decisions.
Brian：核心局限在于，这些启发式规则是在预测 Triton 的决策。

73
00:09:35,729 --> 00:09:43,327
They guess whether values land in registers, shared memory, or tensor memory, and those guesses can be wrong.
它们会猜测数值会落在寄存器、共享内存还是张量内存中，而这些猜测可能出错。

74
00:09:43,327 --> 00:09:52,182
A clean future fix is to compile once, read register and shared-memory usage from the assembler, and correct the estimate.
一个直接的未来修复方案是只编译一次，从汇编器读取寄存器和共享内存用量，然后修正估算。

75
00:09:52,182 --> 00:10:02,400
Ava: They also currently decline kernels whose extents are unknown at compile time, though a rough default or mean might still beat the very poor base default.
Ava：它们目前还会拒绝编译时 extent 未知的内核，不过粗略默认值或均值也许仍能胜过很差的基础默认值。

76
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:12,836
Other future directions include setting more knobs, specializing parent heuristics for families such as vLLM quantization, and supporting more backends.
其他未来方向还包括设置更多参数、针对 vLLM 量化等系列专门化上层启发式规则，以及支持更多后端。

77
00:10:12,836 --> 00:10:20,623
Brian: Today these heuristics are merged into Helion and enabled by default for H100 and B200 on the Triton backend.
Brian：目前，这些启发式规则已合并进 Helion，并在 Triton 后端针对 H100 和 B200 默认启用。

78
00:10:20,623 --> 00:10:28,618
The approach isn't inherently NVIDIA-specific, but its constants and ladders were tuned on those two chips.
这种方法本身并非 NVIDIA 专属，但其中的常数和阶梯参数是在这两款芯片上调出的。

79
00:10:28,618 --> 00:10:39,000
Ava: So the claim is measured: static analysis doesn't beat search, but the gap is now small enough that skipping search is reasonable for some kernels.
Ava：所以，这一结论有测量依据：静态分析没有胜过搜索，但差距已小到某些内核可以合理地跳过搜索。

80
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:45,279
Brian: Full autotuning remains the right call when you're shipping a fixed set of shapes and can pay once.
Brian：如果要发布固定的形状集合且可以一次性承担开销，完全自动调优仍是正确选择。

81
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:52,670
The new option is a strong default config with no tuning time, while helper seeds can shorten the early search.
新选项提供了无需调优时间的高质量默认配置，而辅助种子可以缩短早期搜索。

82
00:10:52,670 --> 00:11:04,204
Ava: Useful takeaway: classify the kernel, estimate resources, choose the main config at compile time, and use related configs to seed autotuning when you need it.
Ava：实用要点是：对内核分类、估算资源、在编译时选择主配置，并在需要时用相关配置为自动调优提供种子。

83
00:11:04,204 --> 00:11:12,366
Brian: And check the conditions behind every speedup: kernel family, shape set, backend, and baseline.
Brian：还要核对每次加速背后的条件：内核系列、形状集合、后端和基线。

84
00:11:12,366 --> 00:11:18,552
Helion's heuristics are enabled by default on H100 and B200 with Triton.
Helion 的启发式规则已在使用 Triton 的 H100 和 B200 上默认启用。

85
00:11:18,552 --> 00:11:20,706
Thanks for listening.
感谢收听。
